      "artist": "Khobbyyyy",
      "description": "Fort Prinzenstein is a historic fortification in Keta, Ghana. Built by European traders, it features thick stone walls and bastions. The fort has strategic coastal views and storage rooms for goods. Its dungeons held enslaved people before transportation. The fort's architecture blends European and local styles. Today, it serves as a museum, showcasing Ghana's complex history. Fort Prinzenstein is a poignant reminder of the transatlantic slave trade's impact.",
